  "content": "[Intro]\n[Gm]\n\n[Verse]\n[Dm]One other\n[Fm]year has\n[A#5]left my life\n[Dm]One year by-\n[Fm]gone so\n[D#]soon\n[Dm]These were the days\n[Fm]I\n[A#5]sacrificed\n[Dm]These days were\nlived for\n[Gm]you\n[Dm]Some came with\n[Fm]winter in white\n[A#5]\n[Dm]Some days were\n[Fm]blown away\n[D#]\n[Dm]Some came with\n[Fm]sultry\n[A#5]summer nights\n[Dm]Some with Oc-\ntober\n[G]rain\n\n[Guitar]\n[Gm]\n[Dm]\n[Gm]\n[Gm]\n[Gm]\n[Gm]\n\n[Verse]\n[Gm]Oh,\n[F]how I\n[C]long\nfor\n[A]utter\n[Gm]si-\nlence\nBut\n[F]who am I to\n[Cm]know\n[A#]When rain\n[Am]will\nturn to snow?\nIf\n[F]life brings\nanother\n[Gm]day\n\n[Outro]\n[Gm]\n[F]\n[Dm]\n[Gm]\n[A#]\n[Dm]\n[Gm]\n[F]\n[Dm]\n[Gm]\n[A#]\n[Dm]\n[Gm]\n[F]\n[Dm]\n[Gm]\n[A#]\n[Dm]\n[Gm]\n[F]\n[Dm]\n[Gm]\n[A#]\n[Dm]\n[Gm]\n[F]\n[Dm]\n[Gm]\n[A#]\n[Dm]\n[Gm]\n[F]\n[Dm]\n[Gm]\n[A#]\n[Dm]\n[Gm]",
